<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Monday at the</p>
<p>$675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Steve Campbell (U.S.) beat 10-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Ranier Schuttler (Germany) beat 13-Juston Gimelstob (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat Cristiano Caratti 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Mark Merklein (U.S.) beat Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.) 4-6 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Michael Tebbutt (Australia) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>11-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Luke Jensen (U.S.) 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Ben Ellwood (Australia) beat Mark Knowles (Bahamas) 5-4</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Luis Herrera (Mexico) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>2-Petr Korda (Czechoslovakia) beat David Nainkin (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Andre Cherkasov (</p>
<p>Russia) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Luke Smith (U.S.) beat 6-Lionel Roux (France) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>7-Scott Draper (Australia) beat Gerard Solves (France) 7-5</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Michael Joyce (U.S.) beat 16-Neville Godwin (South Africa)</p>
<p>7-6 7-6</p>
